This is step by step instruction to use ADfied LAMMPS

ADfied-LAMMPS

1. Download the source file from the folder lammps_AD_implmnt
2. Compile the ADfied LAMMPS as follows and then it is ready to use

cd /lammps_directory/cmake/build/
export NAG_KUSARI_FILE=/location/nag_key.txt
make -C /lammps_directory/src no-all purge
rm CMakeCache.txt
cmake ../cmake -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -D LAMMPS_MACHINE=serial -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$VIRTUAL_EN -D PKG_MOLECULE=ON -D PKG_USER-REAXC=ON -D BUILD_MPI=OFF -D WITH_GZIP=OFF -D WITH_FFMPEG=OFF -D BUILD_OMP=OFF
cmake –build .
/..cmake

3. Compilation and running ADfied LAMMPS is similar to that for standard LAMMPS. Hence for further help please consider the user guide at LAMMPS website: https://docs.lammps.org/#user-guide

